    <h2>1. Privacy — Who This Applies To</h2>
    <p>This policy applies to anyone who visits this site, regardless of where you are located. If you are in the EU or UK, additional rights under GDPR apply (Section 6). If you are in California, additional rights under CCPA apply (Section 7).</p>
  </div>

  <div class="privacy-section">
    <h2>2. What Information Is Collected</h2>
    <p>This site does not use Google Analytics or any third-party analytics tools. I do not track your browsing behaviour, build a profile of your visit, or sell data about you to anyone.</p>
    <p>Netlify, which hosts this site, may collect basic server logs including your IP address and the pages you request. This is standard infrastructure logging governed by <a href="https://www.netlify.com/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Netlify's privacy policy</a>. I do not have access to this data in any personally identifiable form.</p>
    <p>If you contact me by email, I will use your email address only to reply. I do not add your address to any mailing list and I do not retain email correspondence beyond what is reasonably necessary.</p>
  </div>

